{
    "title": "World of Hyatt",
    "description": "From trip planning to hotel checkout, every step of the journey is seamless in the newly improved World of Hyatt app. So once your travels begin, you don\u2019t have to worry about the details\u2014you can just be more here. Not a member yet? Join instantly to get exclusive rates and earn rewards. \r\n\r\nManage your stay with convenient features \r\n- Book with World of Hyatt points, cash or both\r\n- Explore hotel photos, details, offers, local area attractions and more\r\n- Save your favorite hotels for future travel\r\n- Add your reservations and World of Hyatt membership card to Apple Wallet\r\n- Bypass the front desk with self check-in, digital keys and express checkout\r\n- See your room charges in real time\r\n- View and download folios from previous stays\r\n\r\nMake yourself at home\r\n- Request items to your room, such as towels and toothpaste (where available)\r\n- Order room service (where available)\r\n- Stream your favorite shows on your in-room TV with Google Chromecast (where available)\r\n\r\nAccess your account\u200b\r\n- Track your progress toward elite tiers and Milestone Rewards\u200b\r\n- View your current benefits and explore other elite tier benefits\u200b\r\n- Track your progress toward free night Awards via our Brand Explorer\u200b\r\n- View, redeem or gift your available earned Awards\u2028\u200b\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ll always receive the best published rates without any booking fees at any participating Hyatt hotel or resort worldwide. See Hyatt.com for more details. \r\n\u200b\r\nAvailable in English, Spanish, German, French, Japanese, Chinese (Simplified and Traditional) and Korean",
    "descriptionHTML": "From trip planning to hotel checkout, every step of the journey is seamless in the newly improved World of Hyatt app. So once your travels begin, you don\u2019t have to worry about the details\u2014you can just be more here. Not a member yet? Join instantly to get exclusive rates and earn rewards. <br><br>Manage your stay with convenient features <br>- Book with World of Hyatt points, cash or both<br>- Explore hotel photos, details, offers, local area attractions and more<br>- Save your favorite hotels for future travel<br>- Add your reservations and World of Hyatt membership card to Apple Wallet<br>- Bypass the front desk with self check-in, digital keys and express checkout<br>- See your room charges in real time<br>- View and download folios from previous stays<br><br>Make yourself at home<br>- Request items to your room, such as towels and toothpaste (where available)<br>- Order room service (where available)<br>- Stream your favorite shows on your in-room TV with Google Chromecast (where available)<br><br>Access your account\u200b<br>- Track your progress toward elite tiers and Milestone Rewards\u200b<br>- View your current benefits and explore other elite tier benefits\u200b<br>- Track your progress toward free night Awards via our Brand Explorer\u200b<br>- View, redeem or gift your available earned Awards\u2028\u200b<br><br>You\u2019ll always receive the best published rates without any booking fees at any participating Hyatt hotel or resort worldwide. See Hyatt.com for more details. <br>\u200b<br>Available in English, Spanish, German, French, Japanese, Chinese (Simplified and Traditional) and Korean",
